1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,346
Subah se shaam tak ghoomta hoon, phir bhi jeb khaali.

2
00:00:03,646 --> 00:00:10,374
Kallu, sheher mein gaadiyan bahut hain, aur dhone ka time kisi ke paas nahi. Bike aur car wash khol!

3
00:00:10,674 --> 00:00:12,684
Uske liye kya-kya chahiye, Chacha?

4
00:00:12,984 --> 00:00:18,704
Pressure washer, foam machine, vacuum, aur paani wali jagah. 60 hazaar kaafi.

5
00:00:19,004 --> 00:00:24,444
Paani ki nikasi ka intezaam rakhna, aur nagar palika se permission le lena.

6
00:00:24,994 --> 00:00:28,326
Bhaiya, bike keechad se bhari hai. Aaj date pe jaana hai!

7
00:00:28,626 --> 00:00:33,261
Foam wash, polish, sheeshe jaisi chamak. Bike 120, car 400.

8
00:00:33,561 --> 00:00:38,412
Roz 15 bike aur 5 car, yaani din ke 3 hazaar se zyada.

9
00:00:38,712 --> 00:00:44,631
Aur society mein monthly plan becho. Roz subah car saaf, 600 rupaye mahina.

10
00:00:44,931 --> 00:00:47,415
Kallu ki gaadi chal padi! Life set!
